OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry at   
OL,6,Ffirst on Friday but rain arriving into 
OL,7,Fthe west by midday. Further outbreaks  
OL,8,Fof rain and an increasing wind through 
OL,9,FSaturday. Becoming dry by Sunday with  
OL,10,Fsunshine.                              
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
